        {
          "text": "Lino mbaaba bana ba-Rubeni, mwana mutaanzi wa-Israyeli. (Nkaambo ngonguwe iwakataanguna kuzyalwa, nekuba kuti wakacita bumambe amukawisi, aboobo bulemu bwamwana mutaanzi bwakanyanzigwa kulinguwe akupegwa bana ba-Josefa mwana wa-Israyeli. Nciceceo ncatalembelwi mubusena bweelede bwamwana mutaanzi, ",
