        {
          "text": "iwakazyala Beera, ngonguwe Tigilati Pilneseri mwami wa-Asuri ngwaakatola mubuzike, kali silutwe waba-Rubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.6",
