        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakakala kujwe mane kusikila kumagolelo aankanda okuno kutala lyamulonga Firate, nkaambo iŋombe zyabo zyakavula kucisi ca-Gileadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
