        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Leza wa-Israyeli wakabusya moyo wa-Puli mwami wa-Asuri amoyo wa-TigilatiPilineseri mwami wa-Asuri, nkabela ba-Rubeni aba-Gadi acisela camukowa wa-Manase bakabatola boonse mubuzike, babasisya ku-Hala aku-Habori aku-Hara akumulonga Gozani, nkubacibede asunu.",
